# PGO profiles are a protobuf (pprof) binary blob, not text — treat them as
# binary (no diff/merge munging, no EOL normalization) and mark them
# linguist-generated so GitHub collapses them in diffs and excludes them from
# language stats. Forward-prep for a FUTURE committed cmd/mecated/default.pgo
# (the production profile; see docs/design/perf-tracking.md Phase 4). None is
# committed today — the offline `task pgo:collect` profile stays under the
# gitignored .scratch/pgo/.
*.pgo binary linguist-generated

# llms.txt is generated by matlatl (`task docs:llms`) from the doc link graph.
# Mark it linguist-generated so GitHub collapses it in PR diffs and drops it
# from language stats. Regenerate on change; on a merge/rebase conflict, never
# hand-merge — take either side and re-run `task docs:llms`.
llms.txt linguist-generated=true
